    "R13-05x": "431caa freezes seat list, temporarily current=target and restores original visitor4324fa. v37 serializes source/cursor/row/result, interrupts for per-target redirect or empty-facility type, never advances outer day/turn.",
    "R08-01x": "Effects2/10 calculate90*price, update hostility(original target,original visitor) BEFORE441210. Self no change; positive hostility breaks alliance. Web records exact deltas and breaks alliance, does not claim shared AI hostility matrix.",
