    "R12-01x": "Hospital/prison shared helper calls44ba63 with2000*added3*price after status; final target policy128 still covered, company4 signed period/cumulative pays target cash. No fee or immediate bankruptcy/date advance; later15th uses inherited v35 negative dividend callbacks.",
